note Exercism-style exercise "collatz-conjecture": https://exercism.org/tracks/python/exercises/collatz-conjecture
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Return how many steps n takes to reach 1 (n even: n / 2, n odd: 3n + 1). steps 1 is 0.
note Check it with: sh exercise.sh exercises/collatz-conjecture
om2
fn steps n ulong to ulong
v = n
c = ulong 0
while ne v 1 bound 999999
if eq rem v 2 0
v = div v 2
else
v = add mul v 3 1
end
c = add c 1
end
ret c
end
